    "_about": "THE HORSE (2026-11-05): the frame's rig drawn by shapes written for a horse -- a deep chest under high withers and sloping shoulder blades, the barrel to a short loin and a round croup over full haunches and the points of the buttocks; the neck deep at the chest, arching to the poll (a crest), narrow at the throatlatch; a long face from a broad flat forehead to a soft muzzle, round flat jowls behind, tall pointed ears; forearm, knee, cannon with its tendon, fetlock, sloped pastern and hoof in front, the stifle, gaskin and the hock's point behind; the mane in locks falling to the right, the forelock; the rig's own tail kept",
